# Single-page-app fallback for Cloudflare Pages.
#
# The site uses history-based routing, so paths like /patterns exist only inside React
# Router - there is no file at that path to serve. Without this rule, opening or refreshing
# any URL other than / returns Cloudflare's own 404 and the app never boots, which also
# means our own 404 page never renders.
#
# 200 rewrites rather than redirects: the browser keeps the URL it asked for, and React
# Router decides what to show. Real files (/assets/*) are matched first, so this does not
# shadow the build output.
/*    /index.html   200
